    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #43 Review & Parameter Mutation\nOut-of-sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash achieved positive gross expectancy (+\u20b925.72 gross P&L across 10 trades, PF 0.89), demonstrating strong directional alpha that was narrowly negated by transaction fees (\u20b935.94) and tight mid-morning stop whipsaws. Forensics on the losing cluster revealed repeated stop-outs at exactly ~0.55%-0.65% adverse excursion in high-beta metals and banking counters, alongside stagnant late-session entries closing flat at EOD. To convert gross alpha into net profitability for Cycle #44, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to 0.65% to survive normal 5-minute NSE order-book noise, slightly tightening `min_target_pct` to 1.05% to capture full intraday swings prior to EOD decay, lowering `breakeven_trigger_r` to 0.85R to neutralize fee drag earlier in the trade lifecycle, and increasing `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to 2.95x to filter out low-conviction mid-day sweeps."
